BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
UID:TU1892966145
DTSTAMP:20260926T004146Z
SUMMARY:Shomrei Gives Back - Mitzvah Day
DESCRIPTION:**2nd Annual Mitzvah Day**  \n  \nGather as a community in serv
 ice to perform mitzvot for our local social action partners\, Israel\, and
  Shomrei itself. All ages welcome! There is a Mitzvah for everyone\, inclu
 ding kids! Babysitting available for 1st grade and under. Breakfast nosh p
 rovided.  \n  \nOpen to Shomrei Community &amp\; Your Friends.  \n  \n**Pa
 rticipate in any or all activities:**   \n  \nDONATE SUPPLIES** Donate ite
 ms needed to make our Mitzvot a reality. Visit our online wish list to mak
 e a purchase. Make sure items are delivered to Shomrei **by April 15th.** 
 Drop-offs at Shomrei are welcome. Or\, fund the supplies with a monetary d
 onation. You don't have to donate items to participate (but it helps!)  \n
 **online wish list: https://shomrei.org/wishlist**  \n**alternative moneta
 ry donation:** **https://shomrei.org/supplies**  \n **VOLUNTEER YOUR TIME 
 on April 19:**  \n- Assemble Senior grocery bags for Toni's Kitchen\n- Sor
 t donated spring &amp\; summer clothes for Human Needs Food Pantry\n- Asse
 mble "Welcome to Your New Home" kits for Family Promise\n- Make sandwiches
  for MESH\n- Garden outdoors at Shomrei\n- Make friendship bracelets for a
  school in Israel (kid-specific)\n- Color pictures/write letters for senio
 rs (kid-specific)\n- Write thank you cards for pet adoptions for the Montc
 lair Animal Shelter (kid-specific)\n\n  \n**register here: https://shomrei
 .org/mitzvah  \n  \n**PARTICIPATE IN A DRIVE**  \nBring breakfast cereals 
 and/or adult and children’s summer clothing for Human Needs Food Pantry 
 to Shomrei (Drop off at Shomrei or bring with you on Mitzvah day.)  \n  \n
 Key fob required for building entry.  \n   \n**Questions?**  \nContact the
  Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746-5031\n\n
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SEQUENCE:0
