SUMMARY:Mimouna Celebration
DESCRIPTION:**Mimouna Celebration**  \nMimouna is the Moroccan celebration 
 of the end of Passover in which Muslims return non-Passover foods to their
  Jewish neighbors &amp\; bring sweet dessert foods to celebrate the return
  to eating leavened foods again.  \n  \n**Cost:** TBD  \n  \n**RSVP:** Req
 uired so we know how much food to buy.  \n(link)  \n  \n**\\***Members &am
 p\; PreSchool Families should use their fob to access the building.  \n  \
