SUMMARY:Shavuot Community Tikkun @ Shomrei 
DESCRIPTION:**Shavuot Community Tikkun**  \nJoin us for our annual Shavuot 
 community celebration with Bnai Keshet\, Shomrei Emunah\, Temple Ner Tamid
 \, and Temple Sholom of West Essex. Taking place this year at Shomrei Emun
 ah\, we will gather together for a night of prayer\, study\, and Torah. In
  addition to our classes\, taught by local clergy and congregants\, we wil
 l be joined by TBD Speakers.   \n  \nEvening Schedule:  \n7:00pm - Festiva
 l Service  \n7:30pm - Dairy Oneg  \n8:30pm - Keynote Address  \n9:40pm - B
 reakout Study Sessions 1  \n10:50pm - Breakout Study Sessions 2   \n12:00a
 m - Study Session with   \n12:45am - Reading of the Ten Commandments  \n  
 \n  \nNOTE:** This event is still in the planning stages. Please check bac
 k closer to the event for full details.  \n  \n**Open to:**  \nEveryone\, 
 Visitors and Guests Welcome  \n  \n**RSVP Required:**  \nLink TBA\, please
  check back  \n  \n**Members should bring their fobs to enter the building
 .**   \n **Livestream** http://shomrei.org/livestream  \n  \n**Questions?*
