SUMMARY:Concert: An Afternoon of Klezmer
DESCRIPTION:**An Afternoon of Klezmer**  \nJoin us for a Sunday afternoon o
 f listening\, dancing\, and rejoicing with the Isle of Klezbos\, the accla
 imed all-female klezmer ensemble. Described by New York Magazine as “cut
 ting-edge Klezmer\," this powerhouse sextet brings a beautiful balance of 
 tradition and modern flair. Their music spans an incredible variety of sty
 les from neo-traditional folk dance and Yiddish swing to unexpected rhythm
 s like reggae\, retro tango\, and Latin grooves.  \n**Sun\, Nov 8\, 2026\,
  4:00pm**\n\n- $20 in Advance\n- $25 at the Door\n- Under 18 &amp\; Studen
 ts with ID\, Free\n\n**Purchase Tickets Here:** (link to come)  \n  \n***S
 ponsored by the Eric Singer Charitable Fund and Congregation Shomrei Emuna
 h***\n\n\\#ejcc\n\n
