SUMMARY:Theater Outing - Oh\, Mary! 
DESCRIPTION:**Shomrei Theater Outing - *Oh\, Mary!***  \nJoin fellow Shomre
 i theater lovers for this dark comedy about a miserable\, suffocated Mary 
 Todd Lincoln in the weeks leading up to Abraham Lincoln’s assassination.
    \n  \nGroup ticket price of $171 available for Shomrei members &amp\; f
 riends.   \nA minimum of 10 people is needed for this reduced ticket prici
 ng.  \nTickets are in the mezzanine\, rows a-f. (Note that there is no ele
 vator.)  \n  \n**Contact Anita Vogel to RSVP:** avogel1@weichert.com  \n  
 \n**Payment must be received in the Shomrei Office by 12noon on Oct 6th.**
   \nMake checks payable to Congregation Shomrei Emunah.  \nIndicate in the
  memo line that it's for the theatre outing.\n\n
