SUMMARY:Midday Meetup - Piano Concert with Clint Edwards
DESCRIPTION:**Midday MeetUp - Piano Concert with Clint Edwards**   \n  \nA 
 monthly gathering to make connections and learn together.  \n12:30pm Cater
 ed Lunch (free)  \n1:15pm Featured Program   \n  \n**Cost:** FREE or Sugge
 sted Donation of $10 per person to offset costs. (Bill My Account is only 
 open to Shomrei Members)  \n  \n**RSVP:** Required so we know how much foo
 d to buy.  \nhttps://shomrei.easyshul.com/events/6ab6a9eb1d6f8f00272d4371 
  \n  \nWe are pleased to welcome back pianist\, composer\, and music lectu
 rer\, Clint Edwards. Clint will perform pop songs\, light classical\, jazz
  and Broadway tunes while providing commentary and historical insights. Pl
 ease come and enjoy lunch followed by a piano performance for our first Mi
 dday Meetup of the season.   \n  \n**About Clint Edwards**  \nClint Edward
 s is a composer\, arranger\, and pianist. His compositions and arrangement
 s have been performed around the world. He is the winner of the 2019 Broad
 way World Award for Best Independent Album Release. As a pianist\, he regu
 larly gives more than 350 performances a year in the NYC metropolitan area
 . For more information please visit: https://calendar.google.com/calendar/
 u/0/www.ClintEdwardsMusic.com  \n  \n**\\***Members &amp\; PreSchool Famil
 ies should use their fob to access the building.  \n  \n**Mark your calend
 ar for** these additional_dates_for_Midday_MeetUp: https://shomrei.org/cal
 endar/midday-meetup-calendar  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact Office   \noffi
 ce@shomrei.org   \n  \n\\#middaymeetup\n\n
